s or warnings that point to the root cause. For example, if Jaeger can't reach certain services, that would explain the missing data. Alternatively, if the metrics endpoints are misconfigured, Prometheus wouldn't be able to scrape them, leading to empty results. \n\nOnce the logs are reviewed, the next steps would depend on what's found. If there's a configuration error, fixing that would resolve the issue. If there's a network problem, adjusting the network policies or service configurations might be necessary. The goal is to ensure that all services are properly monitored and that the metrics and traces are being collected correctly.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl logs -n train-ticket $(kubectl get pods -n train-ticket -l app=jaeger -o jsonpath=\'{.items[*].metadata.name}\')"}', 'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-b03ca3c08954af53', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 461, 'prompt_tokens': 9499, 'total_tokens': 9960, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cff06-2223-7f23-a739-8f38facf2d90-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd', 'args': {'command': "kubectl logs -n train-ticket $(kubectl get pods -n train-ticket -l app=jaeger -o jsonpath='{.items[*].metadata.name}')"}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-b03ca3c08954af53', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 9499, 'output_tokens': 461, 'total_tokens': 9960}), ToolMessage(content='Command Rejected (ValueError): Unsupported operator kind: commandsubstitution', id='44a0ef8f-89c0-4b12-bb0a-4852cad548ae', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-b03ca3c08954af53'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a too